0	section	Askeladden
1	line	Player	Hi. Are you a member of the council of elders?
1	line	Askeladden	Me? On the council? Ha ha ha ha! Sorry buddy, I'm not a 'real' Fremennik yet! Let me guess, you're trying to get some council members to vote for you?
1	line	Player	That's right, to become a Fremennik.
1	line	Askeladden	You and me both buddy! We're both doing the same trials! This is my trial of manhood! How you finding it so far? Pretty easy, huh buddy?
1	line	Player	It's okay I guess...
1	line	Askeladden	Yeah, that's the spirit buddy! It's all real easy, I wouldn't worry yourself about it, you'll be quaffing beers in the longhall as a Fremennik in no time!
1	action	end
