0	section	Fisherman
1	line	Player	Are you a member of the Fremmenik council?
1	line	Fisherman	Indeed I am, outerlander. Why do you ask?
1	line	Player	Well, I was told by Brundt that I could be voted into the tribe as an honorary Fremmenik if I could find seven members of the council of elders to vote in my favour.
1	line	Fisherman	Aye, that is indeed true.
1	line	Player	So can I have your vote?
1	line	Fisherman	You can have my vote on the day the skies turn red, the waters turn pink, the rocks turn yellow and the sun turns black.
1	line	Player	Um... do you have any estimate on when that is?
1	line	Fisherman	I'm telling you I will never vote for you, you stupid outlander.
1	action	end
