3	action	The player then takes a big drink from his tankard.
3	line	Player	Ish no' fair! (hic) I canna drink another drop! Alsho feel veddy, veddy ill...
3	line	Manni the Reveller	I guessh I win then ouddaladder! (hic) Niche try, anyway!
3	line	Manni the Reveller	Come back if'n you fanshy a rematch! (hic) Jusht let me have a coffee firsht...
3	action	end
2	option	No
3	line	Player	I'm not quite ready yet...
3	line	Manni the Reveller	Want to line your stomach with some food or something, huh outerlander? Come back to me when you're ready to drink.
3	action	end
