0	section	Olaf the Bard
1	line	Olaf the Bard	Hello? Yes? You want something, outerlander?
1	line	Player	Are you a member of the council?
1	line	Olaf the Bard	Why, indeed I am, outerlander! My talents as an exemplary musician made it difficult for them not to accept me! Why do you wish to know this?
1	line	Player	Well, I ask because I am currently doing the Fremennik trials so as to join your clan. I need seven of the twelve council of elders to vote for me.
1	line	Olaf the Bard	Ahhh... and you wish to earn my vote? I will gladly accept you as a Fremennik should you be able to prove yourself to have a little musical ability!
1	line	Player	So how would I do that?
1	line	Olaf the Bard	Why, by playing in our longhall! All you need to do is impress the revellers there with a few verses of an epic of your own creation!
1	line	Olaf the Bard	So what say you outerlander? Are you up for the challenge?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Yes
2	line	Player	Sure! This certainly sounds pretty easy to accomplish - I'll have your vote in no time!
2	line	Olaf the Bard	That is great news outerlander! We always need more music lovers here!
2	action	end
1	option	No
