0	section	Talking to Lalli
1	line	Player	Hello there.
1	line	Lalli	Bah! Puny humans always try steal Lallis' golden apples! You go away now!
1	line	Player	Actually, I'm not after your golden apples. I was wondering if I could have some golden wool; I need it to string a lyre.
1	line	Lalli	Ha! You not fool me human! Me am smart! Other trolls so jealous of how brainy I are, they kick me out of camp and make me live down here in cave! But me have last funny!
1	line	Lalli	Me find golden apples on tree and me build wall to stop anyone who not Lalli eating lovely golden apples! Did me not tell you I are smart?
1	line	Player	Yes, yes, you are incredibly clever. Now please can I have some golden wool?
1	line	Lalli	Hum, me think you not really think I are clever. Me think you is trying trick Lalli. Me not like you as much as other human. He give me present. I give him wool.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Other human?
2	line	Player	Other human? You mean someone else has been there and you gave them wool?
2	line	Lalli	Human call itself Askeladden! It not trick Lalli, Lalli do good deal with human! Stupid human get some dumb wool, but did not get golden apples!
2	line	Player	I see... okay, well, bye!
2	action	end
1	option	No, honest, you're REALLY clever.
2	line	Player	No, honest, you're REALLY clever. Why, I could not contemplate a mere chicanery with an advanced intellect such as you currently present.
2	line	Lalli	Grrr! Why you insult me stupid human? Me know it are because you jealous of Lalli's huge brain and you try steal apples!
2	action	end
1	option	Can I give you a present?
2	line	Player	Can I give you a present? Or maybe exchange you something for some wool?
2	line	Lalli	Ha! You stupid human! You think you trick Lalli? Me know you want my golden apples Well! You not get them! HAHAHA!
2	line	Player	Erm... okay then.
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Askeladden
1	line	Player	Hello there. I understand you managed to get some golden wool from Lalli?
1	line	Askeladden	HAHAHA! Yeah, that Lalli... what a maroon!
1	line	Player	So how did you manage to get the wool?
1	line	Askeladden	Well, as you know, I am doing the same trials that you are as part of my test of manhood, and that troll is the only one who can get that wool.
1	line	Askeladden	You might have noticed he's kind of... messed in the head buddy! He's real paranoid about people stealing his golden apples, isn't he?
1	line	Player	Indeed he is. So how did you manage to get some golden wool from him?
1	line	Askeladden	It was easy buddy! I persuaded him he needed a pet to help him guard his apples. A pet that would never sleep! A pet that would never need food, or exercise!
1	line	Askeladden	A pet that would never need him to clean up its... well, you know, buddy. A pet that would always be loyal to him! A faithful companion for life!
1	action	
1	line	Player	What pet is this then?
1	line	Askeladden	A pet ROCK!
1	line	Askeladden	Man, can you believe that stupid troll traded me some of his golden wool for a worthless ROCK?
1	line	Askeladden	Buddy, I hafta say; if brains were explosives, that troll wouldn't have enough to blow his nose!
1	line	Player	Do you have any spare rocks then?
1	line	Askeladden	Sure thing buddy, although I have to say, I doubt even that troll is stupid enough to fall for the SAME trick TWICE in a row! You can try anyway though!
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Askeladden again
