2	line	Askeladden	Yup, sure is buddy! That Lalli is stupid, even by troll standards!
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player does not have the pet rock:
2	line	Player	Can I have another rock? I lost mine...
2	line	Askeladden	Sure thing buddy! I'd say take better care of this one, but it's just a rock! I have hundreds of them! Go wild!
2	action	
2	action	end
