0	section	Audience member dialogue
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	Hey, I've done that quest too!
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	I have met cows more musical than you!
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	I thought somebody was murdering a cat!
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	Is your singing some kind of outerlander weapon?
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	My grandmother could do better, and she is dead!
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	Please, ye gods! Make it stop!
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	would torture us so, outerlander?
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	Worst. Bard. EVER.
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	You call THAT singing?
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	Don't give up your day job outerlander!
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	I do such feats before breakfast!
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	Never before have mine ears been so offended!
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	Your song makes no sense outerlander!
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	You know, I actually quite liked that verse...
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	That's kind of catchy. Irritating. But catchy.
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	Please... Kill me now...
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	looting and drinking part?
2	line	[Fridgeir/Ospak/Styrmir/Torbrund]	When do you get to the good parts?
