0	section	Sigmund the Merchant's small "favour"
1	line	Player	Hello there!
1	line	Sigmund The Merchant	Hello outerlander.
1	line	Player	Are you a member of the council?
1	line	Sigmund The Merchant	That I am outerlander; it is a position that brings my family and I pride.
1	line	Player	I was wondering if I can count on your vote at the council of elders?
1	line	Sigmund The Merchant	You wish to become a Fremennik? I may be persuaded to swing my vote to your favour, but you will first need to do a little task for me.
1	line	Player	How did I know it wouldn't be that simple for your vote?
1	line	Sigmund The Merchant	Calm yourself outerlander. It is but a small task really... I simply require a flower.
1	line	Player	A flower? What's the catch?
1	line	Sigmund The Merchant	The catch? Well... it is not just any flower. Someone in this town has an extremely rare flower from a far off land that they picked up on their travels.
1	line	Sigmund The Merchant	I would like you to demonstrate your merchanting skills to me, by persuading them to part with it, and then give it to me for my vote.
1	line	Player	Well... I guess that doesn't sound too hard...
1	line	Sigmund The Merchant	Excellent! You will obtain this rare flower for me then?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Yes
2	line	Player	Okay. I don't think this will be too difficult. Any suggestions on where to start looking for this flower?
2	line	Sigmund The Merchant	Ah, well outerlander, if I knew where to start looking I would simply do it myself!
2	line	Player	No help at ALL?
2	line	Sigmund The Merchant	We are a very insular clan, so I would not expect you to have to leave this town to find whatever you need.
1	option	No
2	line	Player	You know what? No. This all sounds like a lot of hassle to me, and frankly I just can't be bothered with it right now.
2	line	Player	I'll go get someone else to vote for me.
2	line	Sigmund The Merchant	As you wish outerlander. If you change your mind, come and see me again; I am very interested in getting my hands on that flower.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player attempts to give Sigmund other types of flowers:
2	action	end
