0	section	Talking to Skulgrimen
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Ask about the Merchant's trial
2	line	Player	I don't suppose you have any idea where I could find a finely balanced custom bowstring, do you?
2	line	Skulgrimen	Aye, I have a few in stock. What would an outerlander be wanting with equipment like that?
2	line	Player	It's for Sigli. It needs to be weighted precisely to suit his hunting bow.
2	line	Skulgrimen	For Sigli eh? Well, I made his bow in the first place, so I'll be able to select the right string for you... just one small problem.
2	line	Player	What's that?
2	line	Skulgrimen	This string you'll be wanting... Very rare. Take a lot of time to recreate. Not sure you have the cash for it.
2	line	Player	Then maybe you'll accept something else...?
2	line	Skulgrimen	Heh. Good thinking outerlander. Well, it's true, there is more to life than just making money. Making weapons is good money, but it's not why I do it.
2	line	Skulgrimen	I'll tell you what. I heard a rumour that one of the fishermen down by the docks caught some weird looking fish as they were fishing the other day.
2	line	Skulgrimen	From what I hear this fish is unique. Nobody's ever seen its like before. This intrigues me. I'd like to have it for myself. Make a good trophy.
2	line	Skulgrimen	You get me that fish, I give you the bowstring. What do you say? We got a deal?
2	line	Player	Sounds good to me.
2	action	end
1	option	Ask about becoming a Fremennik
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Skulgrimen again
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Ask about the Merchant's trial
2	line	Player	I don't suppose you have any idea where I could find an exotic and extremely rare fish, do you?
2	line	Skulgrimen	What? There's another one?
2	line	Player	Er... no, it's the one for you that I'm looking for...
2	line	Skulgrimen	Ah. I see. I already told you. Some guy down by the docks was bragging. Best ask there, I reckon.
2	action	end
