2	action	above
0	section	Talking to the Fisherman
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Ask about the Merchant's trial
2	line	Player	I don't suppose you have any idea where I could find an exotic and extremely rare fish, do you?
2	line	Fisherman	Ah, so even outerlanders have heard of my amazing catch the other day!
2	line	Player	You have it? Can I trade you something for it?
2	line	Fisherman	As exotic looking as it is, it is bad eating. I will happily trade it if you can find me the secret map of the best fishing spots that the navigator has hidden away.
2	line	Player	Is that all?
2	line	Fisherman	Indeed it is, outerlander. The only reason I sit out here in the cold all day long is so I don't have to pay his outrageous prices.
2	line	Fisherman	By getting me his copy of that map, I will finally be self sufficient. I might even make a profit!
2	line	Player	I'll see what I can do.
2	action	end
