0	section	Peer the Seer's favour
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Ask about the Merchant's trial
2	line	Player	I don't suppose you have any idea where I could find a weather forecast from the Fremennik Seer do you?
2	line	Peer the Seer	Er.... Yes, because I AM the Fremennik Seer.
2	line	Player	Can I have a weather forecast then please?
2	line	Peer the Seer	You require a divination of the weather? This is a simple matter for me, but I will require something in return from you for this small service.
2	line	Player	I knew you were going to say that...
2	line	Peer the Seer	Do not fret, outerlander; it is a fairly simple matter. I require a bodyguard for protection. Find someone willing to offer me this service.
2	line	Player	That's all?
2	line	Peer the Seer	That is all.
2	action	end
