2	line	Thorvald the Warrior	If you need to place your equipment into your bank account, I recommend that you speak to the seer, who knows a spell that will do that for you.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player does not have any weapons or armour before entering the arena:
2	action	The person goes into the dungeon.
2	action	end
0	section	During the fight
1	cond	If the player enters the arena:
2	action	end
