0	section	Unlocking the door
1	line	Peer the Seer	Incredible! To have solved my puzzle so quickly! I have no choice but to vote in your favour!
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Peer the Seer again
1	line	Player	So you will vote for me at the council?
